        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William Drea Adams\n- Organizations: Bucknell University, Colby College\n- Roles: university president, educator, humanities advocate\n- Topics: higher education, humanities\n\nFacts:\n- Bucknell University was founded in 1846.\n- Bucknell University offers programs in the arts, humanities, sciences, social sciences, engineering, management, education, and music.\n- Bucknell University also offers programs and pre-professional advising for students preparing to study law and medicine.\n- William Drea Adams is an American educator and advocate for the humanities.\n- William Drea Adams served as President of Bucknell University from 1995 to 2000.\n- William Drea Adams served as the 19th President of Colby College from 2000 to 2014.",
